<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mansa Sakura</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mansa">Mansa</a> Sakura was a ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mali-empire">Mali Empire</a> in the late thirteenth century, a former military commander who seized the throne. According to the empire's profile, his reign brought a military revival, extending <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mali">Mali</a>'s reach north to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niger-bend">Niger bend</a> and west towards the Atlantic. This secured control of key trade routes.</p></div>
